| Area | Contribution |
|:--|:--|
| Productivity | Reduced repeated manual collection and maintenance activities |
| Execution efficiency | Shortened the measured Control-M and cloning workflows |
| Monitoring visibility | Consolidated database and application status into scheduled reports |
| Capacity management | Added growth tracking, space checks, and space-management automation |
| Maintenance consistency | Standardized statistics gathering and log housekeeping |
| Investigation support | Produced audit, alert, and exception information for operational review |
| Extensibility | Enabled additional checks and targets to be incorporated |

Beyond the two measured execution-time improvements, the main value
